---
# Checklist:
# - [x] Resources (requests and limits): `jc --role all` peaked at 99 MiB locally (README.md section 4);
#   the limit leaves room for Antares' memory budget (200 MiB) and Postgres pools
# - [x] 1 Replica: the data claim (ekiben files, shako repositories) is ReadWriteOnce and
#   dataroom, daiya and ekiben keep state in memory; a second replica needs those stores in
#   Postgres first. A rollout surges a second pod on the same node.

replicaCount: 1

resources:
  requests:
    cpu: 250m
    memory: 256Mi
  limits:
    cpu: '2'
    memory: 1Gi
